# UnsignedInteger64 addition of large values

Verifies uint addition of large values near the 64-bit limit through the
complete CLI pipeline.

>>> source
const left: uint = 7000000000000000000
const right: uint = 5000000000000000000

const large_sum: uint = left + right
print(large_sum)

<<< stdout
12000000000000000000

<<< stderr
